    "body": "Hi all, \r\naccording to the EU law on the management of the GDPR privacy and cookies, technical cookies must have a maximum expiration of 6 months.\r\n\r\nOn Volto, we have some technical cookies with infinite or indefinite expiration, namely '**lang**', '**I18N_LANGUAGE**', '**redux_localstorage_simple_blocksClipboard**' cookies.\r\n\r\nIt is possible to change the expiration of these cookies to\r\n6 months? \r\n\r\nWhat do you think? \r\n\r\nAre there any particular reasons why those cookies have an expiration date so far?",
